flowchart TB
  subgraph cp [Control plane]
    admin[An {{users.role.admin}} writes profiles and server scripts]
    sign[The job signing key signs each job]
    secret[Repository secrets for this job only]
  end
  subgraph host [Host]
    verify[The agent checks the signature, addressee, expiry and replay journal]
    steps[Typed restic steps]
    trust[Is the local trust mode on?]
    script[The script runs as root or LocalSystem]
    refuse[The agent refuses the job]
    roots[A restore writes only below the restore roots]
  end
  admin --> sign
  sign ==>|signed job over mTLS| verify
  secret -.->|not stored on the host| verify
  verify --> steps
  verify -->|the job has a script| trust
  trust -->|yes| script
  trust -->|no| refuse
  steps -->|restore| roots
